    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "388280b19a893f38",
      "translationZh": "什么是 Gemma？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "51fc0d7e52427fa1",
      "translationZh": "Gemma 是 Google 基于 Gemini 推出的一个系列，包含 4 个全新的大语言模型（LLM）。它有两种参数规模：2B 和 7B，每种规模都有基础（预训练）版本和指令微调版本。所有变体即使不经过量化，也能在各种类型的消费级硬件上运行，并且上下文长度为 8K 个 token：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "90ceda02f5450a03",
      "translationZh": "gemma-7b：基础 7B 模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bc6c6b49b2e73bc4",
      "translationZh": "gemma-7b-it：基础 7B 模型的指令微调版本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0fc08db16da742f9",
      "translationZh": "gemma-2b：基础 2B 模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d9132d4202d4b7b5",
      "translationZh": "gemma-2b-it：基础 2B 模型的指令微调版本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5d8d1902ef47a21",
      "translationZh": "最初发布一个月后，Google 发布了新版指令模型。这一版本在编程能力、事实准确性、指令遵循和多轮交互质量方面都有提升。该模型也更少以“Sure,”开头。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d71f415f3495c5bf",
      "translationZh": "那么，Gemma 模型究竟有多好？下面概述了这些基础模型及其在 LLM Leaderboard 上与其他开放模型相比的表现（分数越高越好）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e2c614c23f02239",
      "translationZh": "模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c011d6097bfbc8e9",
      "translationZh": "许可证",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "773d36e3dea87d49",
      "translationZh": "可商用？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f7a32ae095768942",
      "translationZh": "预训练规模 [tokens]",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "19885bff2bb71194",
      "translationZh": "排行榜得分 ⬇️",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d9e698bc6fb42018",
      "translationZh": "LLama 2 70B Chat（参考）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6960228bac5a04f2",
      "translationZh": "Llama 2 许可证",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fca8564849fe2efa",
      "translationZh": "Gemma 许可证",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b23a6a8439c0dde5",
      "translationZh": "未知",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b23a6a8439c0dde5",
      "translationZh": "未知",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6960228bac5a04f2",
      "translationZh": "Llama 2 许可证",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fca8564849fe2efa",
      "translationZh": "Gemma 许可证",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d5dfd52fa8036be3",
      "translationZh": "Gemma 7B 是一个非常强大的模型，其性能可与 7B 量级中最优秀的模型相媲美，包括 Mistral 7B。就其规模而言，Gemma 2B 是一个值得关注的模型，但它在排行榜上的得分不及类似规模中能力最强的模型，例如 Phi 2。我们期待收到社区关于实际使用情况的反馈！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "193d185f13884567",
      "translationZh": "请记住，LLM Leaderboard 尤其适合衡量预训练模型的质量，而不太适合衡量聊天模型的质量。对于聊天模型，我们建议运行其他基准测试，例如 MT Bench、EQ Bench 和 lmsys Arena！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e283de02e19f9df0",
      "translationZh": "提示词格式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "79c9426fc39a16de",
      "translationZh": "基础模型没有提示词格式。与其他基础模型一样，它们可用于为输入序列生成合理的后续内容，或进行零样本／少样本推理。它们也是针对你自己的用例进行微调的良好基础。Instruct 版本的对话结构非常简单：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b4cbb46add46f0d3",
      "translationZh": "要有效使用模型，就必须严格复现这一格式。稍后我们将展示，借助 transformers 中提供的聊天模板，复现 instruct 提示词有多么容易。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "315e50f2fa80d790",
      "translationZh": "探索未知",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "96519d0950eb00fc",
      "translationZh": "技术报告包含有关基础模型训练和评估过程的信息，但没有详细介绍数据集的组成和预处理。我们知道，它们使用了来自多种来源的数据进行训练，主要是网页文档、代码和数学文本。这些数据经过过滤，以移除 CSAM 内容和 PII，并进行了许可检查。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3e86e30b2b1244ac",
      "translationZh": "同样，对于 Gemma 指令模型，也未公布有关微调数据集或 SFT 和 RLHF 相关超参数的任何细节。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8a2cc0673b1c4283",
      "translationZh": "演示",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "330917a3d3195a6b",
      "translationZh": "你可以在 Hugging Chat 上与 Gemma Instruct 模型聊天！点击此处链接体验：https://huggingface.co/chat/models/google/gemma-1.1-7b-it",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "74986d675900999d",
      "translationZh": "使用 🤗 Transformers",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5fa05cd2bf192ef",
      "translationZh": "借助 Transformers 4.38 版本，你可以使用 Gemma，并利用 Hugging Face 生态系统中的所有工具，例如：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ce8cfcdc9e839a21",
      "translationZh": "训练和推理脚本及示例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ed89844584690c08",
      "translationZh": "安全文件格式（safetensors）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2c1cbffbd35e572a",
      "translationZh": "与 bitsandbytes（4 位量化）、PEFT（参数高效微调）和 Flash Attention 2 等工具的集成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
